 field renders the physical boundaries and architectural details of the space as an indistinct blur, leaving only a dramatic, wet backdrop defined entirely by the intense, cinematic interplay of deep azure mist and luminous ruby-red light.","A tight close-up shot opens on a heavily misted, rain-soaked alleyway at night, where a thick, cool-toned blue haze rolls across the frame and obscures the deep background. Softly glowing, traditional red paper lanterns hang suspended in the distant background, cutting through the smoky cyan fog to cast warm, diffused crimson halos into the downpour. Lin, a young woman of East Asian descent, stands firmly in the foreground, water glistening across her fair, smooth complexion as rain drips from the fine, wet wisps of her jet-black high ponytail. She wears a soaked, light teal-blue, long-sleeved garment made of a heavily textured, slightly shimmering material that clings tightly to her shoulders and arms. Her hands, encased in thick, dark charcoal distressed gloves, tightly grip the diamond-patterned braided hilt of a traditional katana, pointing the gleaming steel blade forward. Her jaw clenches as she inhales sharply, her chest rising and falling against the wet fabric. Tracking a sudden movement to her right, she rotates her head and torso together naturally, maintaining realistic alignment of her spine and neck as she shifts her weight. She lifts the katana higher into a defensive guard, sending a spray of water droplets slicing through the damp air from the metallic hand guard. A handheld camera pushes in slowly on her face, capturing the dramatic interplay of the dominant cool azure ambient light and the flickering ruby-red rim light reflecting off her wet skin and the steel blade. The natural environment fills with the heavy, persistent ambient sound of pouring rain splashing against the unseen cobblestones, layered with the sharp, metallic swish of the katana cutting through the air, featuring no background music to ensure the scene remains cinematic, ultra-detailed, sharp focus, photorealistic, masterpiece, maintains realistic human anatomy and natural joint rotation throughout.",false,"http://127.0.0.1:11434","gemma4:26b","▼ Video Specs",0,"fixed",1792,768,5,24,"▼ Sampling",3,"euler",1,"16","euler_ancestral_cfg_pp",1.5,"0.55, 0.35, 0.15, 0.0",0.5,true,true,true,30,10,"▼ Refinement",true,true,"codeformer.pth","retinaface_resnet50",0.5,true,true,0.3,"▼ Performance",true,"auto",4,true,"▼ Preview",true],"color":"#323","bgcolor":"#535"},{"id":170,"type":"ColorFX","pos":[4950,2980],"size":[290,300],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":604},{"localized_name":"enable","name":"enable","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_color_correction","name":"enable_color_correction","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_color_correction"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_lut_processing","name":"enable_lut_processing","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_lut_processing"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_enhancements","name":"enable_enhancements","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_enhancements"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_blur_effects","name":"enable_blur_effects","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_blur_effects"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"enable_stylistic_effects","name":"enable_stylistic_effects","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"enable_stylistic_effects"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"grp_color_correction","name":"grp_color_correction","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"grp_color_correction"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"hdr_intensity","name":"hdr_intensity","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"hdr_intensity"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"shadow_intensity","name":"shadow_intensity","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"shadow_intensity"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"highlight_intensity","name":"highlight_intensity","type":"FLOAT","widge